    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, it's profound i guess. but it's also just... heavy. i look at all these people and i realize none of us really matter to anyone else. if i just stopped showing up, if i just stopped existing, the city would just keep spinning like nothing ever happened. it feels like there's no actual point to trying so hard to stay part of it when the connection isn't even real.",
